1.desc:
When the equipper lands a Heavy Strike using <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color>, they gain 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Blade's Edge]</color>. <color=#FFFFFF>[Blade's Edge]</color> stacks up to 2 times, with each skill type providing at most 1 stack. Each stack increases CRIT DMG by <color=#2BAD00>28%</color>, lasting 25s;
Using the aforementioned skills refreshes the duration of <color=#FFFFFF>[Blade's Edge]</color>;
When the equipper has 2 stacks of <color=#FFFFFF>[Blade's Edge]</color>, they gain <color=#FFFFFF>[Bone-Piercing]</color>: <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG dealt is increased by <color=#2BAD00>14%</color></color>, and ignores 14% of the target's <color=#98EFF0>Ice RES</color>.

